            "comment": "DomainBehaviorAndValidation\n|\n+--> CODE ENTITY PRESENTATION\n|    `--> export class CodeEntity\n|         +--> constructor(...)\n|         +--> getSelectionText(...)\n|         |    `--> verify entity reference -> range id/index -> path\n|         `--> prompt_str(...)\n|              `--> render identity + ranges + compaction graphs/mappings\n|\n+--> PROMPT ALIAS PIPELINE\n|    +--> function promptAliasHash(...)\n|    |    `--> FNV-style deterministic 8-hex qualifier\n|    +--> export function qualifiedCodeEntityPromptAlias(...)\n|    |    `--> stable origin identity -> qualified readable alias\n|    +--> export function createCodeEntityPromptAliases(...)\n|    |    `--> deduplicate -> count handles -> qualify collisions\n|    +--> export function resolveCodeEntityPromptAliases(...)\n|    |    `--> reject ambiguous/missing aliases -> persisted ids\n|    +--> function renderCodeEntityPromptAliases(...)\n|    |    `--> ids -> aliases/fallbacks -> comma list\n|    `--> function renderArtifactPromptAscii(...)\n|         `--> rewrite declared [entity-id] annotations to aliases\n|\n+--> ARTIFACT PRESENTATION\n|    +--> export class Diagram\n|    |    +--> constructor(...)\n|    |    `--> prompt_str(...) -> metadata + aliased ASCII\n|    `--> export class DiagramComponent\n|         +--> constructor(...)\n|         `--> prompt_str(...) -> derivation lineage + aliased ASCII\n|\n`--> VALIDATION AND NORMALIZATION\n     +--> export function assertSevenBitAscii(...)\n     |    `--> reject blank or non-ASCII diagrams\n     +--> export function normalizeAscii(...)\n     |    `--> normalize newlines + trim trailing whitespace\n     +--> export function slugify(...)\n     |    `--> lowercase safe slug <= 64 chars or fallback\n     +--> export function assertSafeId(...)\n     |    `--> enforce bounded lowercase id grammar\n     `--> export function assertSourceRange(...)\n          +--> validate relative path, integer bounds, snapshots\n          +--> validate compaction level/section kind/ranges/ASCII\n          `--> validate unique graph lines within section source bounds",
